OL,3,GNEWSAWoman 'fled through window to
OL,4,Aescape abuser'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA domestic abuser whose victim had to
OL,7,Fjump with a fractured eye socket
OL,8,Fthrough a window to escape him has been
OL,9,Fjailed for two years and three months.
OL,11,FBenjamin Ypma, 42, attacked his partner
OL,12,Fmultiple times in September 2025, on
OL,13,Fone occasion strangling and punching
OL,14,Fher in a rage after Newcastle United
OL,15,Fconceded a goal, Newcastle Crown Court
OL,16,Fheard.
OL,18,FThe woman told the court she had been
OL,19,Fmanipulated, isolated and assaulted by
OL,20,Fher abuser and he had "absolutely
OL,21,Fwrecked" who she was.
OL,23,APub: 17-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
